# Capital Operator
#
# The MVP is intentionally zero-config and does not require environment
# variables to run, preview, build, or deploy as a static client.
#
# Public application URLs, Tally form IDs, HubSpot public IDs, Notion public
# reference IDs, and ecosystem links are source-controlled in:
#   src/config/publicEnv.ts
#
# Private server credentials are configured only in the hosting platform
# (for example, Vercel project environment variables) when secure integrations
# are enabled. They are intentionally omitted from this file so Google AI
# Studio does not treat optional integrations as required secrets.
